## Maintenance

1. Read the relevant current spec, then search ADRs, any existing
   `docs/decisions/`, and open and closed Issues.
2. Record confirmed constraints, alternatives, and prior-decision disposition
   in the work item.
3. Update the current spec, ADR, and public documentation in the scoped PR.
   Do not store raw chat transcripts or unconfirmed guesses.
{% if documentation_mode == 'template-and-content' -%}
4. After changing site content, run `./.csarc/scripts/build-repo-site`.
   `./.csarc/scripts/verify` rejects a stale bundle, duplicate spec IDs, and
   incomplete decision metadata.
